'''Elizabeth the LVIth''' (エリザベス56世 Erizabesu 56-sei, ''Lit. Elizabeth the 56th'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. She was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

