==Trivia==
*From her Japanese description, it can be inferred that the mechanical-looking crown on her head is some form of mind-control device that forces her to move involuntarily.
**Interestingly, her "crown" doesn't come off her head during her attack animation, unlike [[Zigge]] and [[St. Pigge the 2nd]].
*[[Suidae Piggicus]]'s description mentions it as Elizabeth the LVIth's pet.
*She is an obvious parody of [[wikipedia:Elizabeth II|Elizabeth II]], hence her name.
*Prior to [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.9 Update|Patch 1.0.9]], in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] she was known as ''Betsy the LVIth'' before being renamed to Elizabeth the LVIth. This was most likely to match the mobile version for consistency reasons.

